name: Bogurodzica;
office-part: Cantio;
mode: 1;
annotation: Cant.;
annotation: I;
book: Kraków, Biblioteka Jagiellońska, MS 1619 (c. 1407–1408), stanzas 1–2;
manuscript: Kraków, Biblioteka Jagiellońska, rkps 1619;
manuscript-storage-place: Kraków, Biblioteka Jagiellońska;
date: c. 1407–1408 (copy); composition probably 13th–14th c.;
transcriber: Critical edition prepared for Mikołaj Derdun, 2026;
commentary: Melody after BJ 1619, collated against the Polona facsimile and Chybiński (1907); text normalised after Woronczak (1962);
user-notes: Pitch letters with clef c4 map to C D E F G a b c' d' as c d e f g h i j k. No B-flat occurs; the single b (i) on spuś-ci is natural. Bar lines are editorial: the source has no divisiones.;
centering-scheme: latine;
